Date:           July 2010
Contact:        Andy Shevchenko <andy.shevchenko@gmail.com>
Description:
		Show or set the reaction on the FUA (Force Unit Access) bit in
		the SCSI WRITE(10,12) commands when a gadget in USB Mass
		Storage mode.

		Possible values are:

			- 1 -> ignore the FUA flag
			- 0 -> obey the FUA flag
